Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I, high school detective, Kudō Shin'ichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...with Ran, my girlfriend since childhood, visited an amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I ended up witnessing a shady deal being done by men in black...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was drugged...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus I shrank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was news that Kudō Shin'ichi is alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,any harm may come to those around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus I became Edogawa Conan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to obtain intel about Black Organisation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones who know my true identity are...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Agasa...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,...and my classmate Haibara Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Her true name is Miyano Shiho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a member of the Black Organisation, codenamed {\b0}Sherry{\b1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The developer of the drug; APTX4869 which shrank my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Having her elder sister shot dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...and caught while trying to escape, took the drug willingly...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sharnk and become Haibara Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's researching for an antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What we know so far is that alcohol is one of the contents in APTX4869.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:00:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It can reverse the effect temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I shrank, my intelligence is still the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:00:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth shall prevail!
